- Initial limit: Higher initial credit limit may indicate higher credit scoring as the bank trusts the client more.  
- BIRTHDATE (Age): Older clients might have more stable financial history, possibly higher credit scoring.  
- SEX: Gender likely has minimal direct effect on credit scoring, but may have some demographic correlation.  
