- LV_SETTLEMENTNAME: Similar regional effect as LV_AREA but more granular.  
- INDUSTRYNAME: Employment in stable or high-income industries may correlate with higher credit scoring.  
- PDN (Probability of Default Number): Higher PDN indicates higher default risk, so lower credit scoring.  
